              "units": 1.0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "audit_criteria",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Opening audit criteria",
          "items": [
            "Opening record tied to one business date",
            "Authorized keyholder and entry time present",
            "Alarm result recorded without reusable credentials",
            "Walkthrough covers exterior and interior conditions",
            "Critical utilities and service systems addressed",
            "Cash handoff references the separate cash record",
            "Exceptions show action, owner, and due point",
            "Opening release decision is explicit",
            "Delayed tasks appear in the next handoff",
            "Closeout and reviewer acknowledgment are complete"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "audit_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Audit conclusion boundary",
          "guidance": "Do not enter, confront a person, disturb suspected evidence, or open to the public when conditions exceed current authorization. Record objective observations and references only; never place alarm codes, safe combinations, or reusable credentials in this form. Follow applicable store, emergency, safety, privacy, and security policy and route judgment to the authorized reviewer."
        }
      ]
    },
